#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000044
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000045
msgid ""
"Ready-to-eat, instant curry developed by the lab boys of MSF's research section.\n"
"Prepared with meat, vegetables and other ingredients cooked in spices, curry dishes are originally an Indian cuisine that made its way to the U.K.\n"
"With its spices acting as preservatives and ingredients that provide balanced nutrition, curry was adopted by the British Navy as military food.\n"
"In the early 20th century, Japan developed curry as rations for their navy. When the soldiers returned home from war, curry gradually found its way into Japanese households.\n"
"Currently, curry is adopted by Japan's Self-Defence Force and is Kaz Miller's favorite dish.\n"
"MSF has developed curry as a ration that can be easily carried, preserved in specially manufactured retort pouches."
msgstr ""
"MSF研究部实验室研发的即食咖喱。\n"
"将肉、蔬菜等食材用香料炖煮而成，咖喱原为印度料理，后传入英国。\n"
"香料可防腐，食材营养均衡，咖喱因此被英国海军采用为军用食品。\n"
"20世纪初，日本为海军开发了咖喱口粮。士兵退伍返乡后，咖喱逐渐进入日本家庭。\n"
"如今，日本自卫队也采用咖喱，是卡兹·米勒最爱的菜。\n"
"MSF将咖喱制成便于携带的口粮，用特制蒸煮袋保存。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000046
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000047
msgid ""
"Ready-to-eat, instant curry developed by the lab boys of MSF's research section.\n"
"Prepared with meat, vegetables and other ingredients cooked in spices, curry dishes are originally an Indian cuisine that made its way to the U.K.\n"
"With its spices acting as preservatives and ingredients that provide balanced nutrition, curry was adopted by the British Navy as military food.\n"
"In the early 20th century, Japan developed curry as rations for their navy. When the soldiers returned home from war, curry gradually found its way into Japanese households.\n"
"Currently, curry is adopted by Japan's Self-Defence Force and is Kaz Miller's favorite dish.\n"
"MSF has developed curry as a ration that can be easily carried, preserved in specially manufactured retort pouches.\n"
"\n"
"Improved version with a flavor that is much closer to freshly cooked curry."
msgstr ""
"MSF研究部实验室研发的即食咖喱。\n"
"将肉、蔬菜等食材用香料炖煮而成，咖喱原为印度料理，后传入英国。\n"
"香料可防腐，食材营养均衡，咖喱因此被英国海军采用为军用食品。\n"
"20世纪初，日本为海军开发了咖喱口粮。士兵退伍返乡后，咖喱逐渐进入日本家庭。\n"
"如今，日本自卫队也采用咖喱，是卡兹·米勒最爱的菜。\n"
"MSF将咖喱制成便于携带的口粮，用特制蒸煮袋保存。\n"
"\n"
"改良版，味道更接近现煮咖喱。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000048
msgid ""
"Ready-to-eat, instant curry developed by the lab boys of MSF's research section.\n"
"Prepared with meat, vegetables and other ingredients cooked in spices, curry dishes are originally an Indian cuisine that made its way to the U.K.\n"
"With its spices acting as preservatives and ingredients that provide balanced nutrition, curry was adopted by the British Navy as military food.\n"
"In the early 20th century, Japan developed curry as rations for their navy. When the soldiers returned home from war, curry gradually found its way into Japanese households.\n"
"Currently, curry is adopted by Japan's Self-Defence Force and is Kaz Miller's favorite dish.\n"
"MSF has developed curry as a ration that can be easily carried, preserved in specially manufactured retort pouches.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Improved to the point that the flavor goes beyond that of freshly cooked curry. Most likely to change the future of cuisine as we know it!"
msgstr ""
"MSF研究部实验室研发的即食咖喱。\n"
"将肉、蔬菜等食材用香料炖煮而成，咖喱原为印度料理，后传入英国。\n"
"香料可防腐，食材营养均衡，咖喱因此被英国海军采用为军用食品。\n"
"20世纪初，日本为海军开发了咖喱口粮。士兵退伍返乡后，咖喱逐渐进入日本家庭。\n"
"如今，日本自卫队也采用咖喱，是卡兹·米勒最爱的菜。\n"
"MSF将咖喱制成便于携带的口粮，用特制蒸煮袋保存。\r\n"
"\r\n"
"改良后味道甚至超越现煮咖喱。很可能改变我们所知的烹饪未来！"

