msgstr "无用途"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x00004e
msgid "On the battlefield, showers are few and far between. And on that important mission, body odor can be a distraction not only to yourself, but to your brothers in arms. That's where this body fragrance comes in, providing a mild aroma that relaxes both body and soul, allowing you and your comrades to focus on the mission at hand."
msgstr "战场上洗澡机会少之又少。执行重要任务时，体味不仅会让自己分心，也会影响战友。这款香体露气味清淡，能放松身心，让你和同伴专心执行眼前的任务。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x00004f
msgid ""
"TPS-L2\n"
"\n"
"The first edition of the \"WALKMAN\" stereo cassette player. Despite its lack of a record function, the WALKMAN defied naysayers in the company and in the public to touch off a revolution in personal sound systems and create a whole new lifestyle. It features the metallic blue body color, akin to the color of blue jeans."
msgstr ""
"TPS-L2\n"
"\n"
"首款“WALKMAN”立体声磁带播放器。虽无录音功能，WALKMAN仍不顾公司内外反对，掀起个人音响革命，开创全新生活方式。金属蓝机身，如牛仔裤的颜色。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000050
msgid ""
"WM-2\n"
"\n"
"Unlike most consumer products, the WALKMAN II was created under a \"design first, engineering afterward\" philosophy. Not only is it even smaller and lighter than the original model - barely the size of a cassette case - it is designed to maximize sound quality, with support for the clear, crisp stereo sound of metal tapes and a built-in anti-rolling mechanism. It's easy to see why the WALKMAN II was such a runaway hit."
msgstr ""
"WM-2\n"
"\n"
"与多数消费品不同，WALKMAN II遵循“先设计，后工程”理念。不仅比初代更小更轻——仅磁带盒大小——还追求最佳音质，支持金属磁带清晰清脆的立体声，内置防滚机构。WALKMAN II大受欢迎不难理解。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000051
msgid ""
"WM-EX88\n"
"\n"
"The EX88 takes the style and functionality of the WALKMAN in an entirely new direction. Its design still emphasizes ease of use above all else, but it also includes a number of handy new features, including track skipping, a hold shutter to keep it locked when not in use, and an \"LCD song search remote\" that displays play info on an LCD screen. "
msgstr ""
"WM-EX88\n"
"\n"
"EX88将WALKMAN的风格与功能引向全新方向。设计仍以易用为先，同时加入多项便利功能，包括跳曲、闲置时锁定的保持快门，以及显示播放信息的“LCD歌曲搜索遥控器”。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000052
msgid ""
"NWD-W202\n"
"\n"
"A WALKMAN with integrated headphones. The display and other functions have been stripped down to the bare essentials to create a lighter, more compact system with simpler controls. It utilizes a spiral neckband to reduce slipping, making it ideal for working out. It also features the \"ZAPPIN<I=TM>\" function that scans songs and lets users enjoy the best parts in short continuous clips like a highlight reel."
msgstr ""
"NWD-W202\n"
"\n"
"耳机一体式WALKMAN。显示屏等功能精简至最低限度，系统更轻更小，操作更简单。采用螺旋颈带减少滑落，适合运动。还具备“ZAPPIN<I=TM>”功能，扫描歌曲并以短片段连续播放精华部分，如精彩集锦。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000053
msgid ""
"Hey. Long time no see, huh?\n"
"\n"
"Sorry for writing to you out of the blue like this. I've been trying to get in touch, but, you know, you haven't been answering... Was it something I said, maybe? If so, I apologize. It's just there's something I want to tell you. So... I decided to put it in a letter...\n"
"\n"
"I mean, obviously this isn't the best time and all. But I was, you know, kind of curious. About your... research and stuff... Speaking of which, how's the pod coming along? I was wondering whether that program I wrote was working or not. You know, the one that links our two AIs together. If it's not, I could always... go over and fix it... if that's OK, of course. For my own peace of mind, really. You know, make sure the program's feeling alright... Er, I guess you wouldn't really say that a program \"has feelings,\" would you? Ha ha ha...\n"
"\n"
"Sorry, I'm getting off track here. So, um, anyway, I've been meaning to tell you something for the longest time. I've been thinking... back when we first met at NASA... Those were fun times. You know, living the dream, getting to work all the time with the... the... science we loved. Ever since then, I've always held you... your... your research, that is... in the highest esteem. No, more than that. I think you're a... a w... w-w-w-wonderful person. Sorry, I don't even know what I'm trying to say here.\n"
"\n"
"So when you disappeared from NASA all of a sudden, I was devastated. That's when it finally dawned on me... I... I need you... For my research, you see. I mean, no! Well, yes... and no. It's hard to explain...\n"
"\n"
"Anyway, when I saw you again in Costa Rica I could hardly believe it. I thought maybe it was divine intervention or something... you know, like it was written somewhere that we were meant to be like this. You and me, the two of us, from now on... you know... just you and me... doing research together. I mean, not just research... Well, there is the research, of course. But research can have so many different meanings, can't it?\n"
"\n"
"I'm rambling again, sorry. But we don't have much time left. When Peace Walker is finished, that's it, right? That's the end of the project. So... what I'm trying to say is... um... Peace Walker is kind of like... something we created together, you know... And when it's finished... then we'll......\n"
"\n"
"...I know, we're not done yet. Need to finish it first, right? Yeah. Until we do, I just hope you won't disappear on me, like you did last time.\n"
"\n"
"Sorry for taking up your time. I wish you the best of luck with your research.\n"
"\n"
"Your dear friend,\n"
"Huey"
msgstr ""
"嘿，好久不见。\n"
"\n"
"抱歉突然写信给你。我一直想联系你，可你一直不回……是我说错什么了吗？如果是，我道歉。只是有些话想告诉你。所以……我决定写下来……\n"
"\n"
"我知道现在不是好时机。但我有点好奇。关于你的……研究什么的……说起来，那个舱进展如何？我想知道我写的程序有没有用。就是把我们两个AI连起来的那个。如果没用，我随时可以……过去修……当然，如果你同意。就当让我安心。确认程序还好……呃，程序大概不能说“还好”吧？哈哈哈……\n"
"\n"
"抱歉，跑题了。总之，我一直想告诉你一件事。我在想……当初我们在NASA初次见面……那段时光真开心。追逐梦想，一直做着……我们热爱的科学。从那时起，我一直对你……你的……你的研究……怀有最高敬意。不，不止如此。我觉得你是个……非……非非非常棒的人。抱歉，我都不知道自己在说什么。\n"
"\n"
"所以你突然从NASA消失时，我崩溃了。那时我才明白……我……我需要你……为了我的研究。不！呃，是……也不是。很难解释……\n"
"\n"
"总之，在哥斯达黎加再见到你时，我简直不敢相信。我想也许是天意……就像命中注定我们该这样。你和我，我们两个，从今往后……你懂的……只有你和我……一起做研究。不，不只是研究……当然也有研究。但研究可以有很多含义，对吧？\n"
"\n"
"我又在胡言乱语了，抱歉。但我们时间不多了。和平行者完成后，就结束了吧？项目就结束了。所以……我想说的是……呃……和平行者就像……我们一起创造的东西……等它完成……我们就……\n"
"\n"
"……我知道，还没完成。得先完成，对吧？嗯。在那之前，只希望你别再像上次那样消失。\n"
"\n"
"抱歉占用你时间。祝你研究顺利。\n"
"\n"
"你亲爱的朋友，\n"
"休伊"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x0000ad
msgid "Canned carbonated drink containing moderate amounts of citric acid and sugar for reducing the effects of fatigue. The refreshing citric taste and the mild stimulation of carbonic acid has an invigorating effect not only physically, but mentally as well."
msgstr "含适量柠檬酸和糖的罐装碳酸饮料，可缓解疲劳。清爽的柠檬味和温和的碳酸刺激，不仅提神，也振奋精神。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x0000ae
msgid ""
"Excess body fat can lower the odds of survival on the battlefield, reducing mobility as well as the stealth benefits of camouflage.\n"
"To keep body fat in check, military R&D developed an artificial sweetener which in turn led to the introduction of a non-sugar, zero-calorie carbonated drink that is way ahead of its time."
msgstr ""
"体脂过多会降低战场生存率，影响机动性和迷彩的隐蔽效果。\n"
"为控制体脂，军方研发部门开发了人工甜味剂，进而推出超前的无糖零卡碳酸饮料。"

