msgid "A cardboard box made of straw. At first glance it may look like just an ordinary box, but if an unsuspecting enemy gets too close he might find himself dragged inside and knocked out cold. In addition, if you have a CO-OPS teammate with the Fulton recovery system equipped, you can send the victim straight back to Mother Base."
msgstr "稻草制成的纸箱。乍看只是普通箱子，但粗心的敌人靠近时可能被拖入箱内打晕。此外，若合作任务队友装备富尔顿回收系统，可将受害者直接送回母基地。"

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000162
msgid ""
"Rathalos\n"
"A winged wyvern, also known as the \"King of the Skies.\" And it certainly lives up to its name. With its deadly breath and claw attacks, Rathalos is synonymous with death from above.\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."
msgstr ""
"火龙\n"
"有翼飞龙，人称“天空之王”。它确实名副其实。凭借致命的吐息和利爪攻击，火龙就是来自天空的死亡代名词。\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000163
msgid ""
"Tigrex\n"
"With a rock-solid body and razor-sharp fangs that can tear through anything, Tigrex is truly the king of beasts. Nothing can stand in its way when it charges. Rub it the wrong way, and you may as well start saying your prayers.\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."
msgstr ""
"轰龙\n"
"岩石般坚硬的身躯加上能撕碎一切的锐利牙，轰龙堪称兽中之王。它冲锋时无人能挡。惹怒了它，就赶紧祈祷吧。\n"
"\n"
"<I=CPY>CAPCOM CO., LTD."

#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000164
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000165
#: slot/0x00904cff/0x0864ad/0x000166
msgid ""
"Gear Rex\n"
"A mysterious member of the dragon family, also known as the \"nuclear dragon.\" Although it lacks wings and cannot fly through the air, a sudden mutation brought on by nuclear testing has given it a giant protuberance reminiscent of a gun turret, from which it spews a highly corrosive liquid that melts absolutely anything it touches."
msgstr ""
"霸王\n"
"龙族神秘成员，人称“核龙”。虽无翼不能飞，但核试验引发的突变让它长出类似炮塔的巨大突起，喷出强腐蚀液体，触之即融。"

